<title>CHILE: Lan Chile reports higher Q1 net.</title>
<headline>Lan Chile reports higher Q1 net.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Linea Aerea Nacional de Chile SA, or Lan Chile, reported the following results for the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>				  Q1 1997		   Q1 1996</p>
<p>Net profit		     7.0			4.5</p>
<p>Operating profit	     8.7			5.6</p>
<p>Non-operating loss	 464 million	loss 493 million</p>
<p>Total revenues		90.8			57.4</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of Chilean pesos except where noted.</p>
<p>((--Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-6995595 x211))</p>
</text>
